			`"Wh-What's that?" Robin asks nervously, staring at your X-Change $xchangePillWord. "Is it... for me?"`,
			`Robin shifts, cheeks pink, gaze fixed on your X-Change $xchangePillWord. "I-If you want me to take it... I-I trust you."`
