					`<<He>> giggles. "That sounds so dirty."`,
					`<<He>> chuckles awkwardly. "Y-You're not embarrassed saying things like that?"`
				)>>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
				"Please," <<he>> heaves. "I'm nothing without you."
				<<set _moanHeal to true>>
			<<elseif C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
				<<He>> laughs softly. "You're really something," <<he>> says.
				<<set _moanHeal to true>>
			<<elseif C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 20>>
				<<He>> giggles softly. "You're really wonderful, you know that?"
				<<set _moanHeal to true>>
			<<else>>
				<<print either(
