				`Robin hisses through <<his>> teeth, then looks wounded by <<his>> own reaction. "Ow. I wasn't going to hurt you."`,
				`<<He>> catches your wrist for a second, startled. "Don't. Please don't make me scared of you."`,
				`Robin stares at the scratch. "I-I... can be rough if you ask, but not like that."`
